---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import EmailSignup from "../components/EmailSignup.astro";
---

<Base title="About" description="Who Pearl Davis is and what JustPearlyThings and The Audacity Network are about.">
  <span class="pill">The story</span>
  <h1>About Pearl</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Pearl Davis is the host of JustPearlyThings and founder of The Audacity Network — one of
    the most-watched independent voices covering dating, family, and the family court system.
  </p>

  <div class="grid cols-3">
    <div class="card center">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;">2M+</h3>
      <p class="muted">YouTube subscribers</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card center">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;">US &amp; UK</h3>
      <p class="muted">Reach</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card center">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Millions</h3>
      <p class="muted">Monthly viewers</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
  <p>
    Pearl has been banned, demonetized, and kicked off platforms more times than she can
    count — nine TikTok accounts, three Instagrams, and two years of YouTube demonetization.
    This website is the answer: an independent home that she owns, where the show, the
    community, and the mission can't be switched off by someone else's moderation policy.
  </p>

  <h2>The mission</h2>
  <p>
    Raise awareness about what men face in dating, marriage, divorce, and child custody —
    and expose uncomfortable truths through journalism, real conversations, documentaries,
    music, and comedy. The Audacity Network gives a platform to the stories the mainstream
    won't tell.
  </p>

  <h2>Press &amp; contact</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    For press, business, and support inquiries:
    <a href="mailto:production@theaudacitynetwork.com">production@theaudacitynetwork.com</a>
  </p>

  <EmailSignup compact />
</Base>
